# Source text is LF on every platform so `prettier --check` (endOfLine: lf) and the
# asset manifests that verify exact SVG bytes do not depend on core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
